{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "description": "Bambu filament/AMS material mapping (schema v2, priority-ordered rules). Each rule matches Spoolman's material/name/manufacturer fields (AND across categories, OR within one category's values) and resolves to either a Bambu AMS profile (tray_info_idx/tray_type/nozzle_temp_min/nozzle_temp_max) or an explicit \"unsupported\" verdict with a reason -- never a guessed profile. When multiple rules match, the highest \"priority\" wins; two rules matching at the same highest priority is a configuration error (ambiguous), not resolved by array order. Temperature values are AMS material metadata, not the actual print temperature. The file is distributed with a SHA-256 checksum and must be validated before activation. This catalog is not exhaustive -- new rules can be added at any time as additional objects in \"rules\", without a firmware rebuild.",
